and manage upward.

306
00:24:43,120 --> 00:24:45,680
<i>Time is precious for everyone at work,</i>

307
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:47,640
<i>including mine.</i>

308
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:48,800
Are you done?

309
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:50,960
I thought your time was worthless,

310
00:24:51,040 --> 00:24:52,400
so I can put off your task.

311
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:57,040
I understand.

312
00:24:57,120 --> 00:24:59,720
In the future,
I'll make my request directly.

313
00:24:59,800 --> 00:25:01,080
Thank you for your guidance.

314
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:04,360
My first project at Lime
was an e-commerce advertisement.

315
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:06,280
This project taught me

316
00:25:06,360 --> 00:25:08,440
to be clear about the scope
of my responsibilities.

317
00:25:09,160 --> 00:25:11,440
<i>Due to a messy report given to the client,</i>

318
00:25:11,520 --> 00:25:13,480
<i>I was scolded by my superior</i>
<i>and felt aggrieved.</i>

319
00:25:13,560 --> 00:25:14,880
<i>Now, I get it.</i>

320
00:25:14,960 --> 00:25:16,800
Being a professional
is not about completing the task,

321
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:18,600
but completing it correctly.

322
00:25:21,440 --> 00:25:23,560
In my third year in Lime,

323
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:25,880
I started digging deeply
into industry data

324
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:29,200
<i>and analyzing</i>
<i>the company's past case reports.</i>

325
00:25:29,280 --> 00:25:31,240
<i>I stepped into our clients' shoes</i>
<i>to think about what they need,</i>

326
00:25:31,320 --> 00:25:33,480
<i>what they care about,</i>
<i>what I can provide to them,</i>

327
00:25:33,560 --> 00:25:34,720
<i>and my individual strength.</i>

328
00:25:36,280 --> 00:25:38,480
<i>Until I completed an S-class project</i>

329
00:25:38,560 --> 00:25:39,800
<i>on my own,</i>

330
00:25:41,320 --> 00:25:43,360
<i>I finally understood</i>

331
00:25:43,440 --> 00:25:47,000
<i>the meaning of being an account manager.</i>

332
00:25:55,360 --> 00:25:56,880
Until now,

333
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:59,080
I still remember the time I first met you.

334
00:26:00,360 --> 00:26:01,640
It has been six years now.

335
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:03,480
Time passes so quickly.

336
00:26:03,560 --> 00:26:06,520
Before the other two judges
ask you questions,

337
00:26:06,600 --> 00:26:08,200
I'd like to thank you

338
00:26:08,280 --> 00:26:09,960
