340
00:26:12,480 --> 00:26:13,960
Thank you, Flora.

341
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:40,960
How was it?

342
00:26:44,080 --> 00:26:45,320
I did my best.

343
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:47,400
When will the result be out?

344
00:26:48,080 --> 00:26:49,520
Probably during the annual meeting.

345
00:26:50,480 --> 00:26:52,640
Then, let me congratulate you

346
00:26:52,720 --> 00:26:55,320
on becoming a Lime Specialist in advance.

347
00:26:57,080 --> 00:26:59,200
Let's pick up Yuanzhu later,
and we'll go grocery shopping.

348
00:26:59,280 --> 00:27:00,920
I must tell Zhu

349
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:02,560
that I completed the work report

350
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:04,680
using the method he taught me.

351
00:27:04,760 --> 00:27:07,480
I must thank him well.

352
00:27:09,560 --> 00:27:11,520
His residential study ends today.

353
00:27:12,520 --> 00:27:14,680
I previously coaxed him

354
00:27:14,760 --> 00:27:16,720
