with me at the hospital.

355
00:27:17,360 --> 00:27:18,720
He does have depression.

356
00:27:20,040 --> 00:27:22,000
However, he is willing to accept treatment

357
00:27:22,080 --> 00:27:24,160
and take medications.

358
00:27:24,240 --> 00:27:26,040
The treatment is quite effective.

359
00:27:27,360 --> 00:27:28,680
He has been eating well,

360
00:27:28,760 --> 00:27:29,720
and he started smiling.

361
00:27:29,800 --> 00:27:31,120
He loves to talk too.

362
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:33,440
A few days ago,
I took him to watch a movie at night.

363
00:27:33,520 --> 00:27:35,320
He was having fun.

364
00:27:35,400 --> 00:27:37,880
He was so happy
that I didn't know what to say.

365
00:27:38,760 --> 00:27:39,960
When I saw him smiling,

366
00:27:40,880 --> 00:27:42,200
I felt happy too.

367
00:27:44,800 --> 00:27:45,920
Me too.

368
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:48,720
When I see both of you happy,

369
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:50,920
I feel happy too.

370
00:27:52,920 --> 00:27:54,400
Our lives

371
00:27:55,160 --> 00:27:57,240
will surely get better.

372
00:27:58,800 --> 00:27:59,800
Yes.

373
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:06,240
Look.

374
00:28:07,760 --> 00:28:08,800
It's so pretty.

375
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:11,280
Hurry.

376
00:28:11,360 --> 00:28:12,680
Take a picture with your phone.

377
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:14,360
Send it to Yuanzhu.

378
00:28:14,440 --> 00:28:15,680
Tell him to wait for us.

379
00:28:41,680 --> 00:28:43,680
Why isn't he picking up?

380
00:28:43,760 --> 00:28:44,840
He's not picking up?

381
