- Let me call him.
- He didn't reply to my text either.

382
00:28:46,080 --> 00:28:46,960
Call him.

383
00:28:47,040 --> 00:28:48,840
THE CROWNING MASTERPIECE
ON CHANG'AN AVENUE

384
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:49,920
Are you calling him?

385
00:28:50,000 --> 00:28:50,880
Yes. He's not answering.

386
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:52,240
He didn't answer?

387
00:28:52,920 --> 00:28:54,600
Is he working overtime without telling me?

388
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:56,920
I don't think so.
He would have told us beforehand.

389
00:28:58,040 --> 00:28:59,800
Let me send him another text.

390
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:03,120
A colleague of mine committed suicide.

391
00:29:04,680 --> 00:29:05,560
It just happened.

392
00:29:09,280 --> 00:29:10,360
He was fine.

393
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:11,880
Why did he commit suicide?

394
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:13,120
‪What's so hard for him to get over?

395
00:29:17,880 --> 00:29:18,920
This place, right?

396
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:21,240
It was split open. His head was…

397
00:29:21,320 --> 00:29:22,600
I heard he was developing
self-driving cars.

398
00:29:22,680 --> 00:29:24,760
- He jumped down from upstairs.
- That floor.

399
00:29:24,840 --> 00:29:25,800
From upstairs.

400
00:29:25,880 --> 00:29:28,120
- It's so tall.
- I wonder what happened to him.

401
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:29,520
I heard the fall was really bad.

402
00:29:29,600 --> 00:29:31,800
Captain, the victim's phone is ringing.

403
00:29:35,360 --> 00:29:36,240
Hello?

404
00:29:37,200 --> 00:29:38,120
Are you the victim's family member?

405
00:30:17,640 --> 00:30:20,520
Officer. Who is this?

406
00:30:20,600 --> 00:30:22,520
An employee of this building.
I can't disclose anything else.

407
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:24,280
An employee?

408
00:30:39,040 --> 00:30:40,800
I really want to jump into the clouds.

409
00:30:43,720 --> 00:30:45,520
<i>Actually, I'm unwell.</i>

410
00:30:45,600 --> 00:30:47,000
<i>I'm very sad.</i>

411
00:30:47,080 --> 00:30:50,480
<i>But no matter what I did,</i>
<i>and how much effort I put into it,</i>

412
00:30:51,480 --> 00:30:54,000
I couldn't achieve the result I wanted.

413
00:30:55,360 --> 00:30:58,800
<i>I've put in 99% effort into it.</i>

414
00:30:59,840 --> 00:31:02,720
<i>Why can't I get that final 1%</i>

415
00:31:02,800 --> 00:31:04,600
<i>luck?</i>

416
00:31:29,760 --> 00:31:30,640
No.

417
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,240
It's not him, right?

418
00:31:52,520 --> 00:31:53,720
No.

419
00:31:53,800 --> 00:31:55,200
It's not real, Tao.

420
00:32:18,360 --> 00:32:19,240
Everyone, don't gather here.

421
00:32:19,320 --> 00:32:20,640
Disperse. Move along.

422
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:21,560
Take care of the body first.

423
00:32:21,640 --> 00:32:23,000
Contact the coroner
and his family members.

424
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:34,560
EMERGENCY RESCUE

425
00:34:38,040 --> 00:34:38,960
You must be hungry.

426
00:34:55,320 --> 00:34:56,840
I am Sun Yuanzhu.

427
00:34:56,920 --> 00:34:57,760
WELCOME HOME

428
00:34:57,840 --> 00:34:59,480
Does your name mean

429
00:34:59,560 --> 00:35:00,680
"With fierce ambition
that reaches beyond the four seas,

430
00:35:00,760 --> 00:35:02,360
I spread my wings
and long to soar to distant horizons?"

431
00:35:03,680 --> 00:35:05,520
I bought many ingredients today.

432
00:35:05,600 --> 00:35:06,600
It's so heavy.

433
00:35:07,200 --> 00:35:08,640
<i>I also bought flour.</i>

434
00:35:08,720 --> 00:35:10,440
<i>Let me make handmade noodles</i>
<i>for all of you later.</i>

435
00:35:12,360 --> 00:35:15,200
<i>I want to get a longer dining table</i>

436
00:35:15,280 --> 00:35:18,080
<i>so everyone can sit and work together.</i>

437
00:35:18,160 --> 00:35:20,720
<i>Then, I want to rearrange the living room.</i>

438
00:35:20,800 --> 00:35:22,640
<i>The sofa and bookshelves are new.</i>

439
00:35:25,120 --> 00:35:27,280
<i>This is Luke's home now.</i>

440
00:36:04,720 --> 00:36:07,400
Tomato and egg noodles without tomatoes

441
00:36:07,480 --> 00:36:09,120
have no souls.

442
00:36:09,840 --> 00:36:11,400
Have a spoonful.

443
00:36:11,480 --> 00:36:13,160
Have two spoonfuls.

444
00:36:15,120 --> 00:36:16,320
Add this yourself.

445
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:19,080
- Try it.
- You too.

446
00:36:19,160 --> 00:36:20,240
Try it first.

447
00:36:28,960 --> 00:36:29,960
<i>Delicious.</i>

448
00:36:31,560 --> 00:36:32,400
<i>Have another spoonful.</i>

449
00:36:42,360 --> 00:36:43,400
Sun Yu.

450
00:36:44,440 --> 00:36:45,720
Sun Yu, stop.

451
00:36:56,960 --> 00:36:58,600
It tastes like Yuanzhu's cooking.

452
00:38:16,600 --> 00:38:20,600
THOUGHTS FROM THE CUTE YUANZHU

453
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:28,880
THOUGHTS FROM THE CUTE YUANZHU

454
00:38:31,200 --> 00:38:32,160
<i>I'm going to be late.</i>

455
00:38:32,240 --> 00:38:34,200
Don't need to send me off. I can go alone.

456
00:38:52,320 --> 00:38:53,400
Will we…

457
00:38:56,120 --> 00:38:58,280
have a bright future ahead of us?

458
00:39:03,080 --> 00:39:04,920
Will I ever get to see the future

459
00:39:05,520 --> 00:39:06,400
where we

460
00:39:07,200 --> 00:39:08,240
love each other

461
00:39:09,320 --> 00:39:13,320
and spend many years
walking through life together?

462
00:39:29,640 --> 00:39:30,480
Sorry.

463
00:39:59,640 --> 00:40:00,600
<i>Sun Yu.</i>

464
00:40:02,480 --> 00:40:04,880
<i>I will watch you fall in love,</i>

465
00:40:05,440 --> 00:40:07,160
<i>get married, have kids,</i>

466
00:40:08,560 --> 00:40:09,880
<i>be happy forever,</i>

467
00:40:10,880 --> 00:40:12,080
<i>and never suffer from beyond the world.</i>

468
00:41:01,720 --> 00:41:03,400
SUN YU: I WILL WATCH YOU FALL IN LOVE
GET MARRIED, HAVE KIDS

469
00:41:03,480 --> 00:41:05,320
BE HAPPY FOREVER
AND NEVER SUFFER FROM BEYOND THE WORLD

470
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:17,600
<i>Sun Yuanzhu,</i>

471
00:41:19,360 --> 00:41:20,960
<i>I hope I can meet you</i>

472
00:41:21,960 --> 00:41:24,000
<i>when I'm 17 years old in my next life.</i>

473
00:41:25,120 --> 00:41:27,160
<i>I want to give all my love</i>

474
00:41:28,520 --> 00:41:29,400
<i>to you.</i>

475
00:41:30,520 --> 00:41:31,840
<i>From when I'm young</i>

476
00:41:32,760 --> 00:41:33,800
<i>until I grow old,</i>

477
00:41:35,680 --> 00:41:36,520
<i>I hope</i>

478
00:41:37,320 --> 00:41:39,800
<i>all the "I love yous" I told you</i>

479
00:41:41,880 --> 00:41:44,120
<i>will become the lights on your journey</i>

480
00:41:45,320 --> 00:41:47,160
<i>that illuminate your path</i>
<i>to the afterlife.</i>

481
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,080
<i>I hope</i>

482
00:41:52,440 --> 00:41:53,520
<i>you no longer suffer.</i>

483
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:16,160
Come in.

484
00:42:17,400 --> 00:42:18,280
Do you want some water?

485
00:42:29,840 --> 00:42:31,280
Yuanzhu's diary.

486
00:42:32,320 --> 00:42:34,720
Keep it. It's a keepsake.

487
00:42:35,720 --> 00:42:36,720
Read it first.

488
00:42:37,280 --> 00:42:38,240
He mentioned you.

489
00:42:52,640 --> 00:42:53,800
<i>Her name is Shang Zhitao.</i>

490
00:42:54,600 --> 00:42:56,000
<i>Like the flourishing peach tree</i>

491
00:42:56,080 --> 00:42:57,160
<i>with its brilliant blossoms,</i>

492
00:42:57,880 --> 00:42:58,920
<i>the name perfectly suits her.</i>

493
00:42:59,840 --> 00:43:01,400
<i>Her bright smile</i>

494
00:43:02,120 --> 00:43:03,720
<i>can light up the whole world.</i>

495
00:43:06,480 --> 00:43:07,840
<i>Tao said</i>

496
00:43:07,920 --> 00:43:10,000
<i>she wanted to receive roses.</i>

497
00:43:10,080 --> 00:43:11,040
Sun Yu,

498
00:43:11,960 --> 00:43:13,480
can you give me a bouquet of flowers?

499
00:43:18,880 --> 00:43:20,320
<i>I gave her flowers for a few days,</i>

500
00:43:20,400 --> 00:43:21,760
<i>and I saw how happy she was.</i>

501
00:43:22,760 --> 00:43:24,680
<i>I hope she can be this happy forever.</i>

502
00:43:29,400 --> 00:43:32,600
<i>Tao wrote these words</i>
<i>on the postcard she sent me from Phuket.</i>

503
00:43:33,360 --> 00:43:35,320
<i>I hope smiles are the only thing</i>

504
00:43:35,400 --> 00:43:36,560
<i>you see in your eyes.</i>

505
00:43:36,640 --> 00:43:38,360
TO SUN YUANZHU
MAY YOUR EYES SEE ONLY SMILES

506
00:43:43,560 --> 00:43:46,080
<i>I want to tell her that I hope</i>

507
00:43:47,200 --> 00:43:48,880
<i>every dream she has</i>

508
00:43:49,680 --> 00:43:51,000
<i>won't be an empty dream.</i>

509
00:43:55,360 --> 00:43:58,400
<i>She is like a shining star.</i>

510
00:43:58,920 --> 00:44:01,440
<i>Pure, wonderful,</i>

511
00:44:04,320 --> 00:44:05,680
<i>and out of reach.</i>

512
00:44:08,520 --> 00:44:10,200
<i>I'm like the fox</i>

513
00:44:10,840 --> 00:44:12,440
<i>who watches over her.</i>

514
00:44:13,600 --> 00:44:15,480
<i>I can only look at her from afar</i>

515
00:44:16,520 --> 00:44:17,560
<i>without approaching her.</i>

516
00:44:19,640 --> 00:44:21,000
<i>I can't have her.</i>

517
00:44:21,520 --> 00:44:23,760
<i>I hope Tao will never know about this.</i>

518
00:44:24,440 --> 00:44:25,280
<i>I hope…</i>

519
00:44:25,360 --> 00:44:26,800
I HOPE SHE CAN BE HAPPY FOREVER

520
00:44:26,880 --> 00:44:28,000
<i>…she can do whatever she wants.</i>

521
00:44:28,080 --> 00:44:32,200
I HOPE SHE CAN DO WHATEVER SHE WANTS

522
00:44:32,280 --> 00:44:34,120
<i>Sometimes, staying away</i>

523
00:44:35,480 --> 00:44:37,000
<i>is also a kind of love.</i>

524
00:44:38,280 --> 00:44:40,680
<i>People were born to be free,</i>

525
00:44:40,760 --> 00:44:43,120
<i>but they are always bound by shackles.</i>

526
00:44:43,720 --> 00:44:46,280
<i>Tao doesn't seem happy</i>
<i>in her relationship.</i>

527
00:44:46,360 --> 00:44:47,960
<i>Perhaps</i>

528
00:44:48,040 --> 00:44:50,400
every relationship is just a hierarchy

529
00:44:51,800 --> 00:44:53,680
until you can stand
on equal footing with one another.

530
00:44:55,160 --> 00:44:56,760
<i>I blame myself.</i>

531
00:44:57,800 --> 00:45:00,400
<i>If I had worked harder</i>
<i>and not had so much burden,</i>

532
00:45:01,920 --> 00:45:04,240
<i>could I bring her happiness?</i>

533
00:45:07,720 --> 00:45:09,360
<i>But perhaps being happy is difficult.</i>

534
00:45:11,240 --> 00:45:12,680
<i>I haven't learned it myself.</i>

535
00:45:14,880 --> 00:45:17,160
<i>April is the most miserable month.</i>

536
00:45:18,560 --> 00:45:19,760
<i>Only faded memories remain</i>

537
00:45:21,160 --> 00:45:22,920
<i>on this barren wasteland.</i>

538
00:45:24,080 --> 00:45:25,760
<i>I'm someone who's empty inside,</i>

539
00:45:26,720 --> 00:45:28,560
<i>wandering in the void.</i>

540
00:45:29,920 --> 00:45:31,200
<i>My heart</i>

541
00:45:32,360 --> 00:45:34,000
<i>has also turned into an empty wasteland.</i>

542
00:45:35,440 --> 00:45:36,360
Mom…

543
00:45:40,720 --> 00:45:41,600
passed away.

544
00:45:44,680 --> 00:45:47,120
<i>I yearn for the rain.</i>
<i>I yearn to be nourished.</i>

545
00:45:47,200 --> 00:45:48,120
<i>I yearn…</i>

546
00:45:51,360 --> 00:45:52,400
<i>to be reborn.</i>

547
00:45:54,800 --> 00:45:55,880
<i>But…</i>

548
00:45:58,400 --> 00:45:59,800
<i>is there still hope?</i>

549
00:46:05,000 --> 00:46:09,800
THAT LIGHT, IT SEEMS UNREACHABLE

550
00:46:10,640 --> 00:46:11,520
<i>Farewell,</i>

551
00:46:12,920 --> 00:46:14,360
<i>the world I loved</i>

552
00:46:16,480 --> 00:46:17,600
<i>and the people I loved.</i>

553
00:46:18,800 --> 00:46:19,880
<i>Let's not see each other again.</i>

554
00:46:37,800 --> 00:46:39,040
So you've always known.

555
00:46:44,720 --> 00:46:45,560
Sun Yu.

556
00:46:55,360 --> 00:46:56,400
I'm so sorry.

557
00:46:58,200 --> 00:46:59,400
Don't be.

558
00:47:00,880 --> 00:47:02,080
I was just

559
00:47:03,640 --> 00:47:04,480
loving him

560
00:47:05,920 --> 00:47:07,080
purely.

561
00:47:08,320 --> 00:47:09,680
It doesn't matter who he liked.

562
00:47:17,320 --> 00:47:19,200
Throughout my long years,

563
00:47:21,320 --> 00:47:24,400
he has given me countless moments
of warmth and kindness.

564
00:47:30,880 --> 00:47:33,080
I, Sun Yu, fell in love with an angel.

565
00:47:40,160 --> 00:47:41,000
He

566
00:47:42,560 --> 00:47:44,200
was an angel.

567
00:47:57,520 --> 00:47:59,320
Why are you crying?

568
00:48:39,360 --> 00:48:41,120
I still remember the time

569
00:48:41,200 --> 00:48:42,640
I first met you.

570
00:48:43,880 --> 00:48:45,240
It has been six years now.

571
00:48:45,320 --> 00:48:46,680
Time passes so quickly.
